    "mottosMarkdown": "## Cavern Sprite Motto Ideas\n\n### Tribal / Philosophical\n\n- \u201cThe Deep Remembers.\u201d\n- \u201cSilence Reveals All.\u201d\n- \u201cWalk Softly Beneath Stone.\u201d\n- \u201cIn Darkness, We Endure.\u201d\n- \u201cThe Caverns Hear Everything.\u201d\n- \u201cStone Above. Silence Within.\u201d\n- \u201cEchoes Guide Us.\u201d\n- \u201cHidden Beneath the World.\u201d\n- \u201cWe Belong to the Deep.\u201d\n- \u201cThrough Silence, We Survive.\u201d\n\n---\n\n### More Cultural / Spiritual\n\n- \u201cEvery Step Leaves an Echo.\u201d\n- \u201cThe Deep Does Not Forget.\u201d\n- \u201cListen Before You Speak.\u201d\n- \u201cStone, Shadow, Silence.\u201d\n- \u201cThe Hollow Protects Its Own.\u201d\n- \u201cFrom Darkness, We See.\u201d\n- \u201cBeneath the Mountain, We Thrive.\u201d\n\n---\n\n### Darker / Harder Tone\n\n- \u201cOnly Silence Survives.\u201d\n- \u201cThe Deep Watches.\u201d\n- \u201cThose Who Shout, Die.\u201d\n- \u201cWe Move Where Light Cannot.\u201d\n- \u201cStone Hides the Patient.\u201d\n- \u201cThe Caverns Keep Our Secrets.\u201d",
    "overviewMarkdown": "**Race Name:** Cavern Sprite  \n**Race Category:** Small Races\n**Race Type:** Sprite  \n**Size:** Small\n**Average Height:** 85\u2013130 cm\n**Average Weight:** 18\u201355 kg  \n**Lifespan:** 180\u2013260 years  \n**Home Region:** Deep Caverns, Crystal Hollows, Fungal Depths, Underground Ruins  \n**Primary Language:** Sprite Speak \n**Secondary Languages:** Common, Undercommon\n**Rarity:** Rare  \n**Alignment Tendencies:** Neutral Good, True Neutral, Chaotic Neutral\n\n# Cavern Sprite \u2014 Short Summary Paragraph\n\n> Cavern Sprites are small subterranean Feykin who dwell deep beneath the world within crystal caverns, fungal forests, and forgotten underground ruins. Known for their gray-toned skin, sharp elven features, and silent movements, they are masters of stealth, resonance, and survival within the endless dark. Curious yet cautious, Cavern Sprites preserve the balance of underground ecosystems and rarely trust surface dwellers.\n\n# Official Cavern Sprite Motto\n\n> **\u201cStone, Shadow, Silence.\u201d**\n\n![[Pasted image 20260525214029.png]]",
