    "racialBonusesMarkdown": "### \u26a0\ufe0f Drawbacks\n- Very fragile (low HP potential)  \n- Extremely low strength  \n- Reliant on magic and positioning  \n- Vulnerable if grounded or restrained  \n\n---\n\n> \"Fate doesn\u2019t guide us\u2026 it dances with us.\"\n\u2014 Lirael, Emberwing Pixie"
