    "overviewMarkdown": "- Race Category: Demi-Race\n- Race Type: Spiritborn Humanoid\n- Parent Race: Frost Spirit \u00d7 Humanoid\n- Playable: Yes\n- Rarity: Rare",
    "racialFeaturesMarkdown": "- Height Range:\n  - Male: 170cm - 200cm\n  - Female: 160cm - 190cm\n\n- Weight Range:\n  - 65kg - 120kg\n\n- Skin:\n  - Cool to the touch\n  - Smooth with subtle crystalline textures\n  - Colour Range:\n    - Ice Blue\n    - Frost White\n    - Pale Silver\n    - Glacier Grey\n    - Arctic Blue\n\n- Hair:\n  - Often resembles flowing snow or frozen silk\n  - Colour Range:\n    - White\n    - Silver\n    - Pale Blue\n    - Frost Grey\n    - Crystal Blonde\n\n- Eyes:\n  - Bright and reflective like frozen lakes\n  - Colour Range:\n    - Ice Blue\n    - Silver\n    - White\n    - Pale Violet\n    - Crystal Cyan\n\n- Hands:\n  - Long fingers\n  - Naturally resistant to cold\n  - Slightly crystalline fingernails\n\n- Face:\n  - Elegant features\n  - Calm and reserved expressions\n  - High cheekbones common\n\n- Ears:\n  - Slightly elongated\n  - Frost-like fin ridges\n\n- Markings:\n  - Naturally occurring frost patterns\n  - Glowing snowflake-like runes\n  - Intensify during ice magic use\n\n- Body:\n  - Lean and athletic\n  - Built for endurance in harsh climates\n  - Graceful but deliberate movement\n\n---",
    "racialCharacteristicsMarkdown": "| Characteristic | Buff/Debuff | Stat Rolls | Characteristics Tier Cap |\n| -------------- | ----------- | ---------- | ------------------------ |\n| Strength       | -2          | 4d6        | Tier 3                   |\n| Dexterity      | 0           | 3d6        | Tier 4                   |\n| Agility        | 0           | 3d6        | Tier 5                   |\n| Constitution   | +1          | 4d6        | Tier 5                   |\n| Endurance      | +2          | 4d6        | Tier 4                   |\n| Intelligence   | +1          | 4d6        | Tier 4                   |\n| Wisdom         | +1          | 4d6        | Tier 5                   |\n| Charisma       | 0           | 4d6        | Tier 4                   |\n| Luck           | 0           | 3d6        | Tier 5                   |\n\n---",
    "racialTraitsMarkdown": "### Frost Sense\n\n#### Description\nFrostborn can feel changes in temperature, ice formations, snowfall, and cold mana currents around them.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Gain +2 Perception in snowy, icy, or cold environments.\n- Can sense approaching blizzards and severe weather several hours in advance.\n- Detect nearby sources of ice magic within 18 metres.\n- Gain advantage on Survival checks in frozen environments.\n\n---\n\n### Heart of Winter\n\n#### Description\nThe essence of eternal winter flows through every Frostborn.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Resistant to Cold damage.\n- Immune to natural environmental cold.\n- Ignore penalties from snow, ice, and freezing temperatures.\n- Ice and Frost spells cost 10% less Mana.\n\n---\n\n### Frozen Resolve\n\n#### Description\nLike ancient glaciers, Frostborn possess patience and resilience beyond most mortal races.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Gain +2 on rolls against Fear effects.\n- Gain +2 on rolls against environmental exhaustion caused by cold climates.\n- Recover Stamina 25% faster while in cold environments.\n- Gain advantage against effects that force panic or emotional manipulation.\n\n---\n\n### Breath of the Glacier\n\n#### Description\nThe body of a Frostborn is naturally adapted to survive beneath frozen waters.\n\n#### Gameplay Effect\n- Can breathe underwater indefinitely.\n- Ignore underwater combat penalties.\n- Swimming speed is doubled.\n- Can safely swim in freezing waters without harm.\n\n---",
    "racialMovementMarkdown": "- Swim Speed: 18m\n- Ignore movement penalties caused by snow and ice.\n- Move normally across frozen lakes and icy terrain.\n- Gain +3m movement speed during blizzards or snowstorms.\n- No penalties from freezing water.\n\n---",
    "racialBonusesMarkdown": "### \u2705 Bonuses\n- Superior Cold Resistance\n- Enhanced Ice Magic\n- Excellent Survival Skills\n- High Endurance\n- Strong Mental Resilience\n\n### \u26a0\ufe0f Drawbacks\n- Sensitive to extreme heat.\n- Fire Magic deals increased damage.\n- Reduced comfort in tropical climates.\n- Require more hydration in hot environments.\n\n---",
